  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level and every 2 levels thereafter, the sphereshaper unlocks chakra binds in the following order: Hands, Feet, Head, Wrist, Shoulders, Headband, Neck, Belt, Chest, and Body. Once a sphereshaper has unlocked a chakra bind, they may choose to bind a veil to that slot when shaping it to unlock its corresponding bind abilities.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/sphereshaper#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
